---

<BaseLayout
  title="Bench Press Grip Guide | Modern Men's Fitness"
  description="Complete bench press grip guide — width, thumb position, wrist alignment, suicide grip vs full grip. Jordan Hoppel."
  canonical="https://modernmensfitness.com/bench-press-technique/grip/"
  schema={schema}
